        "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>Note:</strong> Please refer to the following before installing the solution:</p>\n<p>• Review the solution <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/tree/master/Solutions/FireCompassRisks/ReleaseNotes.md\">Release Notes</a></p>\n<p>• There may be <a href=\"https://aka.ms/sentinelsolutionsknownissues\">known issues</a> pertaining to this Solution, please refer to them before installing.</p>\n<p>The <strong>FireCompass Risks</strong> solution provides a Codeless Connector Framework (CCF) data connector that pulls risk findings from the FireCompass platform REST API into Microsoft Sentinel. Risk records are ingested into the FCRisks_CL custom table for analysis, correlation with endpoint telemetry, and closed-loop remediation.</p>\n<p><strong>Data Connectors:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/azuresentinel\">Learn more about Microsoft Sentinel</a> | <a href=\"https://aka.ms/azuresentinelsolutionsdoc\">Learn more about Solutions</a></p>\n",
